## Current Active Claims
{% for claim in active_claims %}
- [{{ claim.claim_id }}] ({{ claim.facet }}): {{ claim.text }} {{ claim.citations }}
  Preconditions: {{ claim.preconditions }}
{% endfor %}

## New Constraints
{{ constraint_deltas }}

## Impact Analysis
{% for impact in impacts %}
- Claim {{ impact.claim_id }}: {{ impact.action }} — {{ impact.reason }}
{% endfor %}

## New Evidence (for affected claims only)
{% for chunk in new_chunks %}
### [{{ chunk.citation_label }}]
{{ chunk.text }}
{% endfor %}

## Allowed Citations
{{ allowed_citations | join(', ') }}

## Instructions
1. RETAIN unchanged claims verbatim — do not rephrase them.
2. SUPERSEDE affected claims with updated versions citing new evidence.
3. ADD new claims if the new evidence reveals additional information.
4. Cite ONLY from the Allowed Citations list.
5. Produce a unified narrative, not a list of changes.
